/E (Food waste is a growing challenge that has far-reaching socioeconomic and environmental consequences. Despite significant advancements in agriculture and food production, millions of people continue to suffer from hunger and undernourishment, while large volumes of edible food are discarded at various stages of the supply chain. This mismatch between abundance and scarcity inspired the creation of a technology- driven solution, one that could harness the power of web platforms to connect donors and distributors and ensure surplus food benefits those who need it most.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
