/E (Food wastage is a major issue causing economic loss, environmental damage, and worsening hunger. Existing food donation methods lack coordination, proper tracking, and real-time updates, resulting in inefficiencies and missed opportunities to help those in need. This project aims to develop a digital system that connects donors, administrators, and delivery agents to streamline food donations and ensure surplus food reaches beneficiaries efficiently and transparently.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
