/E (In this phase, the system is tested from an end-user perspective by verifying core workflows such as donor registration, food donation posting, admin approval, NGO selection, and delivery assignment. Acceptance testing confirms that the system works correctly across all modules \(User, Admin, and Delivery Person\) Successful acceptance testing indicates that the project is ready for deployment and practical use in reducing food wastage.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [27]
>>
